      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s88k",
          "text": "When a dangerous or defective product injures you or a loved one, you can bring a legal claim against the manufacturer, designer, or distributor of that product. The products you use every day should not cause severe or life-threatening injuries when used as expected. Corporations need to hold accountable for placing these products in the marketplace.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b88n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s88m",
          "text": "At Dormer Harpring, our lawyers want you to fully recover from your product liability injuries and move forward with your life. We fight on your behalf and know the tactics insurance companies use to resist paying claims. Our Highlands Ranch product liability attorneys are:",
          "marks": []
        }
