          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b88z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s88y",
          "text": "Colorado product liability laws are complex, and lawsuits for product liability injuries must meet specific deadlines. Consulting a product liability lawyer as soon as possible after your accident is essential. At Dormer Harpring, our attorneys will inspect the defective product, determine how your injury occurred, and how the defect caused your injury.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
